  "body": "Here's your chance to get on the property ladder within one of the Whangaparaoa Peninsula's most loved suburbs! Renovated, beautifully presented and packed with personality, 36a Zealandia Road is a sunny two-bedroom home with room to relax, entertain and enjoy, with the bonus of Little Manly Beach at the end of the street. Whether you're taking your first step into home ownership or adding a smart investment to your portfolio, this is an accessible way into a suburb where weekends revolve around the beach, the boat ramp and a good coffee in the village.\r\n\r\nFeatures you'll love:\r\n* Just 400 metres from Little Manly Beach.\r\n* Less than 100m walk to Whangaparaoa Primary via the nearby walkway.\r\n* Two generous bedrooms.\r\n* Well-appointed bathroom complete with a bath.\r\n* Light-filled, open-plan kitchen, dining and living, with crisp neutral decor.\r\n* Heat pump for comfortable living in every season.\r\n* Sun-soaked deck, perfect for weekend BBQs.\r\n* Crosslease section with a half share in 811sqm.\r\n* Vegetable gardens for your own home grown produce.\r\n* Carport plus additional off-street parking.\r\n\r\nManly is at the heart of coastal living on the Peninsula, with sandy beaches, excellent schools and the sailing club, local cafes and everyday amenities all close at hand, and everything the wider Hibiscus Coast has to offer within easy reach. With Penlink under construction and set to improve connectivity, there's another good reason to get into this coastal community now.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of being close to everything while having your own sunny spot to come home to. Don't let this one pass you by.\r\n\r\nAUCTION: Thursday 10th December from 3:00pm (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nTo download the property documents please visit: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/41UZ\r\n\r\n- Flexible settlement terms available\r\n- Other agents bring your buyers, conjunctionals welcome",
